      "html": "<div id=\"step-q213401\" class=\"step questionWidget\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 3</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\">Select the correct options in the reasoning below.<p></p>The integer <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"78\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"80\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> \n<div id=\"selectList-213401-0\" class=\"selectList\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrameDisabled correctSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-213401-0\" style=\"width: 112px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\">does not have</div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1; left: 476px; top: 3271px;\"><div class=\"selectListOption selected\" style=\"height: 17px;\">does not have</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">has</div></div></div>\na multiplicative inverse modulo <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"79\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n